message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "You Only Live Twice: VOLCANO — Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  PROJECT BOND film package for You Only Live Twice (1967), mission codename
  VOLCANO. Deterministic special-agent mission software: orbital rendezvous /
  intercept window solving, concealed-lair detection via thermal and terrain
  anomaly scoring, and base pattern-of-life analysis, exposed through the
  BOND-API MissionProvider protocol.
